course: dictionary
lesson: 15391
title: Speedy means fast
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Speedy means fast, moving or happening quickly. «The speedy rabbit dashed across the field.» The rabbit is not walking slowly. It is moving very fast.
explain: Speedy can also mean happening soon, without any delay. «The shop gave us speedy service, so we did not wait long.» Nobody had to wait, so the service was quick.
explain: A good check is to swap in the word fast. «The fast rabbit dashed across the field» still makes sense, so speedy means fast here. Speedy is a friendly, everyday word, so you will often hear it in shops, letters and cards.
fact: Speedy means fast, moving or happening quickly.
fact: Speedy can also mean happening soon, without delay.
fact: Speedy is an adjective. Its forms are speedy, speedier and speediest.
fact: «A speedy reply» means an answer that comes quickly.
fact: Phrases you may see: «speedy recovery», «speedy service», «speedy delivery», «speedy reply».
exercise: «The speedy fox dashed past the gate.» What does speedy mean here? | Slow and lazy | *Fast and quick | Very old | Hungry
exercise: «We got a speedy reply to our letter the very next day.» What does speedy suggest about the reply? | It came very late | *It came quickly, without delay | It was rude | It was written in a foreign language
exercise: «The speedy train rushed into the station.» Find and copy one word that means the same as speedy. | quiet | *quick | slow | heavy
test: Mia says speedy is just another word for slow. Is she right? | *No, speedy means fast, not slow | Only in the morning | Yes, speedy means lazy | Yes, speedy means slow
test: «Thanks for the speedy delivery of my parcel.» What does speedy delivery mean? | *The parcel arrived quickly | The parcel was broken | The parcel was sent back | The parcel was too heavy
exam: Which phrase means the same as «a speedy recovery»? | *Getting better quickly | Losing the way home | Getting lost on a long trip | Feeling very hungry
